===== DONE =====

-- Notes (real-run variance, not errors):
--  * www.oracle.com sometimes hits ORA-29276 transfer timeout (slow CDN from CN);
--    re-run usually OK. Not a cert/validation issue.
--  * S7: scheme prefix is case-insensitive (SYSTEM:/System: both OK), but the
--    trailing colon is required (system without colon -> ORA-29248).
--  * S5: file: needs an Oracle wallet dir (ewallet.p12/cwallet.sso); pointing file:
--    at the OS PEM bundle dir OR a non-existent dir -> ORA-28759.
--  * S8: the wallet only matters for HTTPS; plain HTTP works regardless.
